{95}{Well, I'm actually a rancher. I raise Billy-bumblers. These animals are the best pet a man can have. They're loyal, very quick on their feet, and smart as all hell. Some of 'em even learn to talk! There's a big demand around here for well-bred Billies, and I do a good trade in them.}{Well, I'm actually a rancher. I raise Billy-bumblers. These animals are the best pet a man can have. They're loyal, very quick on their feet, and smart as all hell. Some of 'em even learn to talk! There's a big demand around here for well-bred Billies, and I do a good trade in them.}{}{}{}{}
