{110}{Oh, chunks of human flesh, mostly. Just kidding, heh heh. They're omnivores, but they prefer vegetables and roots to meat, for the most part. They just need some red meat every once in a while to stay strong.They can go for days without food if necessary, though.}{Oh, chunks of human flesh, mostly. Just kidding, heh heh. They're omnivores, but they prefer vegetables and roots to meat, for the most part. They just need some red meat every once in a while to stay strong. They can go for days without food if necessary, though.}{}{}{}{}
